==English==
{{wikipedia}}

===Etymology===
''Cease'' essentially meaning "stop", and ''desist'' meaning "not do it again."

===Verb===
{{head|en|verb}}

# {{lb|en|idiomatic|legal}} To stop and not resume an action.
#: ''We are told to '''cease and desist''' or we will cease to exist.''

